@page "/"

<PageTitle>Return to Self | Reiki &amp; Body Balancing</PageTitle>

<section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="hero-copy">
            <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--on-navy">Reiki &amp; Body Balancing</span>
            <h1 class="brand-stack">Space to slow down.<br />Return to yourself.</h1>
            <div class="hero-rule"></div>
            <p class="tagline">Meet Mary and Leslie. Sisters with a shared intention: to help you feel heard, supported, and more connected to yourself.</p>
            <a class="btn btn-cream" href="#practitioners">Meet Your Practitioners</a>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-art" role="img" aria-label="A lit candle beneath an olive branch, warm sunlight casting shadows on a navy wall"></div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="practitioners" id="practitioners">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading">
            <span class="eyebrow">The People Behind Return to Self</span>
            <p>We bring our own experiences and perspectives to a welcoming space where you can arrive just as you are.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="practitioners-grid">
            <article class="practitioner-card">
                <div class="practitioner-photo" aria-hidden="true"></div>
                <h3 class="practitioner-name">Mary</h3>
                <span class="practitioner-title">Reiki I &amp; II Therapist &middot; Dynamic Body Balancing Facilitator</span>
                <div class="practitioner-bio">
                    <p>A mother and former educator, Mary brings a caring, intuitive, and nonjudgmental approach to her work. She is passionate about helping you explore the connection between your emotions, beliefs, and sense of self.</p>
                </div>
                <a class="btn btn-navy" href="about#mary">Meet Mary</a>
            </article>
            <article class="practitioner-card">
                <div class="practitioner-photo" aria-hidden="true"></div>
                <h3 class="practitioner-name">Leslie</h3>
                <span class="practitioner-title">Dynamic Body Balancing Facilitator &middot; Lactation Educator</span>
                <div class="practitioner-bio">
                    <p>A mother of two, Leslie's own experience of motherhood inspired her work. She is passionate about helping mothers and children feel supported, understood, and connected, while encouraging parents to trust their intuition.</p>
                </div>
                <a class="btn btn-navy" href="about#leslie">Meet Leslie</a>
            </article>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="content-section alt">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading">
            <span class="eyebrow">Our Services</span>
            <h2>Find Your Way Back to Balance</h2>
            <p>Explore Reiki and Body Balancing.</p>
        </div>
        <ServiceOverview />
    </div>
</section>

<section class="about-preview">
    <div class="about-preview-media" role="img" aria-label="A candle beside clear quartz crystals and olive branches"></div>
    <div class="about-preview-copy">
        <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--on-navy">A Personal Approach</span>
        <p>Not Sure Where to Start?</p>
        <h2>Let's Find the Right Session for You</h2>
        <p>Whether you're drawn to Reiki or curious about Body Balancing, you're welcome to start with a conversation. We'd love to hear what brings you here.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-cream" href="contact">Get in Touch</a>
    </div>
</section>
